The following is a list of ways I've compiled to deal with cursed items that
you can not get off ( including the iron ball ).
Most 'Hackers' are already aware of most of these, but for those newcomers
who'd like a clue or two, this may be usefull.
The chances of some of the techniques working vary from guaranteed
(ie:holy water) to very remote (ie:magic trap) but they are all possible.
There may be ways I've not thought of, and would appreciate any other additions.
Also included are basic methods to find/get the neccessary 'equipment' to
perform the removal...

     _KEY_
	* : not gauranteed to help
	+ : cursed item will become uncursed
	- : cursed item will be destroyed
	# : item still cursed but no longer worn


These techniques work for any cursed item
	- remove curse scroll ( blessed or uncursed ) (+)
	- remove curse spell learned from a spellbook (+)
	- get a nymph to steal it (#) 
	- pray to your Almighty God (*+)
	- sit on a throne (*+)
	- dip it in holy water (+)
	- dip it in a fountain (*+)
	- walk on a magic trap (*+)

Weapons
	- enchant it with an uncursed or blessed enchant weapon scroll (+)
	- enchant it with a cursed enchant weapon scroll below -5 (*-)
	- polymorph into something with no hands/opposable thumbs to hold
		it (ie:mimic/dragon/dog) (#)
	- #force a locked chest with it (*+)

Armour
	- get a succubus/incubus to take it off for you (#)
	- enchant it with an uncursed or blessed enchant armor scroll (+)
	- destroy it with a destroy armor scroll (-)
	- polymorph yourself. Depends on the kind of armour you wish to
	  get rid of...
	  boots : something with claws/no feet (ie:dragon/mimic) (#)
		  levitation boots can be removed by levitating over a sink (#)
	  gloves : something with claws/no hands (ie:dragon/mimic) (#)
	  cloaks&body armour : anything large (-)
			       or small (it falls off) (#)
	  shields : something with claws/no hands (#)
	  helms : something with no head or a big one (#)
	- get it disintigrated (ie:black dragon breath,demon lord)  (*-)

Rings
 	- levitating over a sink will remove a ring of levitation (#)

Ball & Chain
	- polymorph yourself into a water nymph and #monster to remove the
	  chain	


TO GET:
  scrolls (enchant armor/weapon, remove curse, destroy armor)
	- find them
	- wish for them
	- find or make blank ones and write your own
	- polymorph other scrolls into the ones you want (*)

  holy water (blessed potion of water)
	- find some
	- drop a cursed/uncursed potion of water onto a lawful alter
	- wish for it
	- polymorph other potions into water (*)

  nymphs
	- run across one
	- play in a fountain (ie: quaff/dip) (*)
	- read a cursed scroll of genocide on nymphs
	- attempt to polymorph another monster into one <--- yeah, right!

  succubus/incubus
	- run across one
	- kick a sink (*)
	- read a cursed scroll of genocide on succubus/incubus
	- attempt to polymorph another monster into one <--- again: yeah, righ!

  polymorphed
	- ring of polymorph
	- wand of polymorph directed at yourself
	- polymorph trap
	- eat a chameleon corpse
	- quaff from a sink (*)
	- get stricken with lycanthropy (ie:from a werewolf/wererat/werejackel)
	- polymorph spell learned from spellbook


That is all.

ps - Sinks are fun! 
